# API Layer Integration - Service Mesh Template

```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph "Data Plane"
        subgraph "Service A Pod"
            AppA[Application A]
            SidecarA[Envoy Sidecar]
        end
        
        subgraph "Service B Pod"
            AppB[Application B]
            SidecarB[Envoy Sidecar]
        end
        
        subgraph "Service C Pod"
            AppC[Application C]
            SidecarC[Envoy Sidecar]
        end
    end
    
    subgraph "Control Plane"
        Pilot[Pilot / Istiod]
        Citadel[Citadel / CA]
        Galley[Galley / Config]
    end
    
    AppA --> SidecarA
    AppB --> SidecarB
    AppC --> SidecarC
    
    SidecarA <--> SidecarB
    SidecarB <--> SidecarC
    SidecarA <--> SidecarC
    
    Pilot --> SidecarA
    Pilot --> SidecarB
    Pilot --> SidecarC
    
    Citadel --> SidecarA
    Citadel --> SidecarB
    Citadel --> SidecarC
    
    Galley --> Pilot
    
    style Pilot fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32
    style Citadel fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#ef6c00
    style Galley fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#1565c0
```

